!! **Payments integration is red.** The payment processor's test environment is five weeks late. The fallback is to build against recorded responses, which costs about 3 weeks of extra effort.

## Decision needed

! **Decision for the steering committee by 2026-11-06:** cut over all states at once, or in two waves. **We recommend two waves.**

table = option,what happens,effect; **Two waves (recommended)**,"The 14 smaller states cut over in January, the rest in February","Halves the number of agent re-trainings happening at the same time"; Single cutover,All states cut over at once,"Every agent is re-trained at the same time"

Why two waves: it halves the number of agent re-trainings happening at the same time, so a problem in the first wave affects only the 14 smaller states. The go-live target of 2027-02-15 holds either way.
